@Api.TestGsm_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

### Health Check (vérifier le statut de l'API et du modem)
GET {{Api.TestGsm_HostAddress}}/api/gsm/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Initialisation du Module GSM
POST {{Api.TestGsm_HostAddress}}/api/gsm/init
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Lancer un Appel de Test (avec audio OK)
POST {{Api.TestGsm_HostAddress}}/api/gsm/call
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+33612345678",
  "audioOk": true
}

###

### Lancer un Appel de Test (sans vérification audio)
POST {{Api.TestGsm_HostAddress}}/api/gsm/call
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+33698765432",
  "audioOk": false
}

###

### Raccrocher l'Appel
POST {{Api.TestGsm_HostAddress}}/api/gsm/hangup
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Workflow Complet de Test
# 1. Health Check
GET {{Api.TestGsm_HostAddress}}/api/gsm/health

###

# 2. Initialisation
POST {{Api.TestGsm_HostAddress}}/api/gsm/init

###

# 3. Appel avec Audio
POST {{Api.TestGsm_HostAddress}}/api/gsm/call
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+33612345678",
  "audioOk": true
}

###

# 4. Raccrocher
POST {{Api.TestGsm_HostAddress}}/api/gsm/hangup

###
